(Run it locally) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Requires Node.js 22 or newer. From the project folder:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Run `npm install`.) Tj
T*
(2. Optionally copy `.env.example` to `.env` and adjust local settings.) Tj
T*
(3. Run `npm run dev`.) Tj
T*
(4. Open `http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health`.) Tj
T*
(5. Run `npm test` for the health test or `npm run lint` for linting.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The default database and Redis URLs are configuration values only; the app does not connect) Tj
T*
(to those services yet.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Suggested build order) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Authentication and user identity.) Tj
T*
(2. Tenant context and business-scoped repository filters.) Tj
T*
(3. Services and staff.) Tj
T*
(4. Schedules.) Tj
T*
(5. Appointments.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Git status) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The scaffold was pushed to the `develop` branch in commit `4f2aef8` \(`Scaffold ServiceHub) Tj
T*
(backend`\). The blueprint PDF in the project folder was left uncommitted.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
